// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_rundll32_sys.yml
// ID Sigma: 731231b9-0b5d-4219-94dd-abb6959aa7ea
// Título: Suspicious Rundll32 Activity Invoking Sys File
// Descripción: Detects suspicious process related to rundll32 based on command line that includes a *.sys file as seen being used by UNC2452
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: high
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_rundll32_sys.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "rundll32.exe" and (ProcessCommandLine contains ".sys," or ProcessCommandLine contains ".sys ")
